      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\"><title>Self-Loop Bottleneck</title><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0a0a1a;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:20px}h1{font-size:1.3em;color:#8af;margin-bottom:4px}h2{font-size:.85em;color:#888;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:20px}.row{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}.card{background:#12122a;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;width:160px;text-align:center;border:2px solid transparent;transition:border-color .3s}.card.perfect{border-color:#ff6b6b44}.card.imperfect{border-color:#4ecdc444}.card h3{font-size:.95em;margin-bottom:4px}.card .count{font-size:2.5em;font-weight:bold;margin:8px 0}.card.perfect .count{color:#ff6b6b}.card.imperfect .count{color:#4ecdc4}.dots{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;justify-content:center;min-height:40px;margin-top:8px}.dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;opacity:0;animation:fadeIn .5s forwards}.card.perfect .dot{background:#ff6b6b}.card.imperfect .dot{background:#4ecdc4}@keyframes fadeIn{to{opacity:1}}.summary{margin-top:24px;padding:16px 24px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:8px;max-width:600px;text-align:center;font-size:.85em;line-height:1.6}</style></head><body><h1>Self-Loop Bottleneck</h1><h2>How many ways can voices move while preserving the same interval?</h2><div class=\"row\" id=\"cards\"></div><div class=\"summary\"><b>Perfect consonances are rigid:</b> only the identity (no motion) is allowed as a self-loop.<br><b>Imperfect consonances are flexible:</b> all 12 parallel motions are permitted.<br>Ratio: <b>12 : 1</b> — the categorical manifestation of the parallel-fifths prohibition.</div><script>const intervals=[{id:0,name:'Unison',perfect:true,loops:1},{id:3,name:'min 3rd',perfect:false,loops:12},{id:4,name:'Maj 3rd',perfect:fa