ntity for Voice Leading</h1><h2>cost(m₁ ⊓ m₂) + cost(m₁ ⊔ m₂) = cost(m₁) + cost(m₂)</h2><div class='main'><div class='panel'><h3 style='color:#ff6b9d'>Motion m₁</h3><div id='s1'></div><h3 style='color:#60a5fa;margin-top:16px'>Motion m₂</h3><div id='s2'></div><h3 style='color:#c084fc;margin-top:16px'>Computed</h3><div class='cost-display'><div class='cost-box'><span class='clabel'>m₁ ⊓ m₂ (meet)</span><span class='cval' id='meet-val'></span></div><div class='cost-box'><span class='clabel'>m₁ ⊔ m₂ (join)</span><span class='cval' id='join-val'></span></div></div></div><div class='panel' style='min-width:360px'><h3>Voice Components</h3><div style='display:flex;gap:20px'><div><div class='bar-container' id='bars1'></div><div style='text-align:center;font-size:.8em;color:#999'>m₁ components</div></div><div><div class='bar-container' id='bars2'></div><div style='text-align:center;font-size:.8em;color:#999'>m₂ components</div></div><div><div class='bar-container' id='bars-meet'></div><div style='text-align:center;font-size:.8em;color:#999'>meet</div></div><div><div class='bar-container' id='bars-join'></div><div style='text-align:center;font-size:.8em;color:#999'>join</div></div></div><h3 style='margin-top:16px'>Costs</h3><div class='cost-display'><div class='cost-box'><span class='clabel'>‖m₁‖₁</span><span class='cval' id='c1' style='color:#ff6b9d'></span></div><div class='cost-box'><span class='clabel'>‖m₂‖₁</span><span class='cval' id='c2' style='color:#60a5fa'></span></div><div class='cost-box'><span class='clabel'>‖m₁⊓m₂‖₁</span><span class='cval' id='cm' style='color:#a0f0a0'></span></div><div class='cost-box'><span class='clabel'>‖m₁⊔m₂‖₁</span><span class='cval' id='cj' style='color:#f0d060'></span></div></div><div class='equation' id='eq'></div><div class='equation' id='tri' style='font-size:.9em'></div></div></div><script>const NV=4;const labels=['S','A','T','B'];let m1=new Array(NV).fill(0),m2=new Array(NV).fill(0);function makeSliders(containerId,arr,color){const