    {
      "title": "L¹-Lattice Identity Explorer",
      "description": "Enter two voice motions and verify the L¹-lattice conservation law: cost(m₁ ⊓ m₂) + cost(m₁ ⊔ m₂) = cost(m₁) + cost(m₂).",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\"><title>L¹-Lattice Identity</title><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0a0a1a;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:20px;min-height:100vh}.title{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#64b5f6,#ce93d8);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;margin-bottom:4px}.subtitle{font-size:.82rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center;max-width:600px}.container{max-width:700px;width:100%}.panel{background:#12122a;border:1px solid #2a2a4a;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px}.panel h3{color:#64b5f6;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:12px}.row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.row label{width:30px;font-weight:700;color:#ce93d8;font-size:.9rem}input[type=number]{width:60px;padding:6px 8px;background:#1a1a3a;border:1px solid #3a3a5a;border-radius:6px;color:#fff;font-size:.9rem;text-align:center}input[type=number]:focus{outline:none;border-color:#64b5f6}.btn{padding:8px 20px;background:#1e88e5;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.9rem;margin-top:8px}.btn:hover{background:#42a5f5}.result{margin-top:16px;padding:16px;background:#1a1a3a;border-radius:8px;font-family:monospace;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.8}.eq{color:#ffb74d;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem}.check{font-size:1.2rem}.bar-container{display:flex;gap:2px;align-items:flex-end;height:80px;margin-top:12px;padding:8px 0}.bar{min-width:40px;border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:.75rem;color:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding-bottom:4px;transition:height .3s}.bar-label{font-size:.7rem;color:#aaa;margin-top:4px;text-align:center}#voices{font-size:.85rem;color:#aaa;margin-bottom:8px}</style></head><body><div class=\"title\">L¹-Lattice Identity Explorer</div><div class=\"subtitle\">The conservation law: cost(m₁ ⊓ m₂) + cost(m₁ ⊔ m₂) = cost(m₁) + cost(m₂)</div><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"panel\"><h3>Voice Motions</h3><div id=\"voices\">4 voices — enter integer semitone displacements</div><div class=\"row\"><label>m₁</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"m1_0\" value=\"2\"><input type=\"number\" id=\"m1_1\" value=\"-1\"><input type=\"number\" id=\"m1_2\" value=\"3\"><input type=\"number\" id=\"m1_3\" value=\"0\"></div><div class=\"row\"><label>m₂</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"m2_0\" value=\"1\"><input type=\"number\" id=\"m2_1\" value=\"2\"><input type=\"number\" id=\"m2_2\" value=\"-1\"><input type=\"number\" id=\"m2_3\" value=\"4\"></div><button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"compute()\">Compute</button><button class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#7b1fa2;margin-left:8px\" onclick=\"randomize()\">Random</button></div><div class=\"panel\"><h3>Results</h3><div id=\"resultArea\" class=\"result\">Click Compute to see the identity in action.</div><div class=\"bar-container\" id=\"barChart\"></div></div><div class=\"panel\" style=\"font-size:.82rem;color:#aaa;line-height:1.6\"><h3>About This Identity</h3><p><strong>Theorem <code>cost_meet_join_eq</code></strong>: For any voice motions m₁, m₂ in Fin n → ℤ, the L¹ cost of the componentwise minimum (lattice meet ⊓) plus the cost of the componentwise maximum (lattice join ⊔) equals the sum of the individual costs.</p><p style=\"margin-top:8px\">This identity reduces pointwise to |min(a,b)| + |max(a,b)| = |a| + |b| and represents a <em>conservation law</em>: decomposing voice motions via lattice operations redistributes cost without creating or destroying it.</p></div></div><script>function getMotion(prefix){return[0,1,2,3].map(i=>parseInt(document.getElementById(prefix+'_'+i).value)||0)}function cost(m){return m.reduce((s,x)=>s+Math.abs(x),0)}function meet(a,b){return a.map((v,i)=>Math.min(v,b[i]))}function join(a,b){return a.map((v,i)=>Math.max(v,b[i]))}function compute(){const m1=getMotion('m1'),m2=getMotion('m2');const mt=meet(m1,m2),jn=join(m1,m2);const c1=cost(m1),c2=cost(m2),cmt=cost(mt),cjn=cost(jn);const lhs=cmt+cjn,rhs=c1+c2;const ok=lhs===rhs;let html='';html+='m₁ = ['+m1.join(', ')+']    cost(m₁) = '+c1+'\\n';html+='m₂ = ['+m2.join(', ')+']    cost(m₂) = '+c2+'\\n\\n';html+='m₁ ⊓ m₂ = ['+mt.join(', ')+']  cost = '+cmt+'\\n';html+='m₁ ⊔ m₂ = ['+jn.join(', ')+']  cost = '+cjn+'\\n\\n';html+='<span class=\"eq\">'+cmt+' + '+cjn+' = '+lhs+'   vs   '+c1+' + '+c2+' = '+rhs+'</span>\\n';html+='<span class=\"check\">'+(ok?'✅ Identity verified!':'❌ Error — this should never happen')+'</span>\\n\\n';html+='Triangle inequality: cost(m₁+m₂) = '+cost(m1.map((v,i)=>v+m2[i]))+' ≤ '+c1+'+'+c2+' = '+(c1+c2)+'  '+(cost(m1.map((v,i)=>v+m2[i]))<=c1+c2?'✅':'❌');document.getElementById('resultArea').innerHTML=html;const maxVal=Math.max(c1,c2,cmt,cjn,1);const bars=[{label:'cost(m₁)',val:c1,color:'#1e88e5'},{label:'cost(m₂)',val:c2,color:'#42a5f5'},{label:'cost(m₁⊓m₂)',val:cmt,color:'#7b1fa2'},{label:'cost(m₁⊔m₂)',val:cjn,color:'#ce93d8'}];const chart=document.getElementById('barChart');chart.innerHTML='';bars.forEach(b=>{const h=Math.max(4,b.val/maxVal*60);const div=document.createElement('div');div.className='bar';div.style.height=h+'px';div.style.background=b.color;div.style.flex='1';div.innerHTML=b.val+'<div class=\"bar-label\">'+b.label+'</div>';chart.appendChild(div)})}function randomize(){[0,1,2,3].forEach(i=>{document.getElementById('m1_'+i).value=Math.floor(Math.random()*11)-5;document.getElementById('m2_'+i).value=Math.floor(Math.random()*11)-5});compute()}compute()</script></body></html>"
