lf-Loop Counts by Interval Type</h3><div id='bars'></div><div style='margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:#888'>Perfect consonances (P1, P5) admit only 1 self-loop — the identity (0,0).<br>Imperfect consonances (m3, M3, m6, M6) admit all 12 parallel self-loops.<br>This 12:1 ratio is the <em>bottleneck theorem</em>.</div></div><div class='section'><h3>Voice-Leading Cost Calculator</h3><p style='font-size:12px;color:#888;margin-bottom:8px'>Enter two voice motions as comma-separated integers (e.g., \"2,-3,1\"). The calculator verifies the lattice-cost conservation identity in real time.</p><div class='cost-calc'><div class='cost-input'><label>Motion m₁:</label><input id='m1' value='2,-3,1' oninput='calcCost()'></div><div class='cost-input'><label>Motion m₂:</label><input id='m2' value='-1,4,0' oninput='calcCost()'></div></div><div class='result-grid' id='results'></div></div><script>const intervals=[{name:'Unison (P1)',type:'perfect',loops:1},{name:'Minor 3rd (m3)',type:'imperfect',loops:12},{name:'Major 3rd (M3)',type:'imperfect',loops:12},{name:'Perfect 5th (P5)',type:'perfect',loops:1},{name:'Minor 6th (m6)',type:'imperfect',loops:12},{name:'Major 6th (M6)',type:'imperfect',loops:12}];const barsDiv=document.getElementById('bars');intervals.forEach(v=>{const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='bar-row';const pct=v.loops/12*100;const color=v.type==='perfect'?'#f59e0b':'#6366f1';row.innerHTML=`<div class='bar-label'>${v.name}</div><div class='bar-container'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:${pct}%;background:${color}'>${v.loops}</div></div>`;barsDiv.appendChild(row)});function parse(s){return s.split(',').map(x=>parseInt(x.trim())).filter(x=>!isNaN(x))}function cost(m){return m.reduce((s,x)=>s+Math.abs(x),0)}function vecOp(a,b,fn){const n=Math.max(a.length,b.length);return Array.from({length:n},(_, i)=>fn(a[i]||0,b[i]||0))}function calcCost(){const m1=parse(document.getElementById('m1').value);const m2=parse(document.getElementById('m2').value);if(m1.length===0||m2.length===0){document.getElementById('results').innerHTML='<div style=\"grid-column:1/-1;color:#888;font-size:12px\">Enter valid integer vectors.</div>';return}const meet=vecOp(m1,m2,Math.min);const join=vecOp(m1,m2,Math.max);const sum=vecOp(m1,m2,(a,b)=>a+b);const c1=cost(m1),c2=cost(m2),cMeet=cost(meet),cJoin=cost(join),cSum=cost(sum);const lhs=cMeet+cJoin,rhs=c1+c2;const conserved=lhs===rhs;const triangle=cSum<=c1+c2;const r=document.getElementById('results');r.innerHTML=`<div class='result-box'><div class='val'>${c1}</div><div class='lbl'>cost(m₁)</div></div><div class='result-box'><div class='val'>${c2}</div><div class='lbl'>cost(m₂)</div></div><div class='result-box'><div class='val'>${cSum}</div><div class='lbl'>cost(m₁+m₂) ${triangle?'≤':'>'} ${c1+c2}</div></div><div class='result-box'><div class='val'>${cMeet}</div><div class='lbl'>cost(m₁⊓m₂) = cost(${meet.join(',')})</div></div><div class='result-box'><div class='val'>${cJoin}</div><div class='lbl'>cost(m₁⊔m₂) = cost(${join.join(',')})</div></div><div class='result-box ${conserved?'eq-box':'neq-box'}'><div class='val'>${lhs} = ${rhs} ${conserved?'✓':'✗'}</div><div class='lbl'>Lattice Conservation</div></div>`}calcCost()</script></body></html>"
