      "description": "Visualize the involution i ↦ −i on ZMod 12 and see how it maps the perfect fifth to the dissonant perfect fourth, breaking consonance.",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\"><title>Voice-Swap Asymmetry</title><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0a0a1a;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:30px}h1{font-size:1.4em;color:#7eb8ff;margin-bottom:5px}h2{font-size:.9em;font-weight:normal;color:#888;margin-bottom:25px}.main{display:flex;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start}canvas{border-radius:12px;background:#12122a;border:1px solid #2a2a5a}.side{max-width:300px}.card{background:#16163a;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;border:1px solid #2a2a5a;margin-bottom:15px}.card h3{color:#7eb8ff;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:1em}.mapping{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 0;font-size:.9em}.mapping .arrow{color:#888}.mapping .from{min-width:40px;text-align:right}.mapping .to{min-width:40px}.ok{color:#51cf66}.broken{color:#ff6b6b;font-weight:bold}button{background:#2a2a5a;color:#e0e0e0;border:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.95em;margin-top:10px;transition:background .2s}button:hover{background:#3a3a7a}button.active{background:#4a4a9a}</style></head><body><h1>Voice-Swap Asymmetry</h1><h2>The map i ↦ −i (mod 12) breaks consonance at the perfect fifth</h2><div class=\"main\"><canvas id=\"clock\" width=\"420\" height=\"420\"></canvas><div class=\"side\"><div class=\"card\"><h3>The Involution i ↦ −i</h3><p style=\"font-size:.85em;color:#aaa;margin-bottom:10px\">Swapping bass and soprano voices maps interval i to −i (mod 12). This reflects intervals across the 0-6 axis.</p><div id=\"mappings\"></div></div><div class=\"card\"><h3>Key Insight</h3><p style=\"font-size:.85em;color:#aaa\">The perfect fifth (7) maps to 5 — the perfect fourth — which is <span class=\"broken\">not consonant</span> in first-species counterpoint. The bass voice is algebraically privileged.</p></div><button id=\"toggle\" class=\"active\">Show involution mapping</button></div></div><script>const canvas=document.getElementById('clock'),ctx=canvas.getContext('2d'),W=420,H=420,CX=W/2,CY=H/2,R=160;const names=['0 (P1)','1','2','3 (m3)','4 (M3)','5 (P4)','6 (tt)','7 (P5)','8 (m6)','9 (M6)','10','11'];const consonant=new Set([0,3,4,7,8,9]);const perfect=new Set([0,7]);let showMapping=true;function getPos(i){const angle=-Math.PI/2+i*(2*Math.PI/12);return{x:CX+R*Math.cos(angle),y:CY+R*Math.sin(angle)};}function draw(){ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);ctx.strokeStyle='#2a2a5a';ctx.lineWidth=1;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(CX,CY,R,0,2*Math.PI);ctx.stroke();if(showMapping){const pairs=[[3,9],[4,8],[7,5]];pairs.forEach(([a,b])=>{const pa=getPos(a),pb=getPos(b);ctx.beginPath();ctx.setLineDash([5,5]);const isBroken=!consonant.has(b)||!consonant.has(a);ctx.strokeStyle=a===7||b===7?'rgba(255,107,107,0.6)':'rgba(81,207,102,0.4)';ctx.lineWidth=a===7||b===7?3:1.5;ctx.moveTo(pa.x,pa.y);ctx.lineTo(pb.x,pb.y);ctx.stroke();ctx.setLineDash([]);const mx=(pa.x+pb.x)/2,my=(pa.y+pb.y)/2;ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.5)';ctx.font='10px sans-serif';ctx.textAlign='center';});}for(let i=0;i<12;i++){const p=getPos(i);const isCons=consonant.has(i);const isPerf=perfect.has(i);const r=isCons?20:12;ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(p.x,p.y,r,0,2*Math.PI);if(isCons){if(isPerf){const g=ctx.createRadialGradient(p.x,p.y,0,p.x,p.y,r);g.addColorStop(0,'#ff8a8a');g.addColorStop(1,'#cc4444');ctx.fillStyle=g;}else{const g=ctx.createRadialGradient(p.x,p.y,0,p.x,p.y,r);g.addColorStop(0,'#6de08a');g.addColorStop(1,'#2d8a4e');ctx.fillStyle=g;}}else if(i===5){ctx.fillStyle='#553333';ctx.strokeStyle='#ff6b6b';ctx.lineWidth=2;ctx.fill();ctx.stroke();ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.font='bold 11px sans-serif';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.textBaseline='middle';ctx.fillText(i.toString(),p.x,p.y);const lp={x:p.x,y:p.y+r+14};ctx.fillStyle='#ff6b6b';ctx.font='10px sans-serif';ctx.fillText('P4 ✗',lp.x,lp.y);continue;}else{ctx.fillStyle='#2a2a3a';}ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='#fff';ctx.font=`bold ${isCons?12:10}px sans-serif`;ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.textBaseline='middle';ctx.fillText(i.toString(),p.x,p.y);if(isCons){const lp={x:p.x,y:p.y+r+14};ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.5)';ctx.font='10px sans-serif';ctx.fillText(names[i].split(' ')[1]||'',lp.x,lp.y);}}}const mappingsDiv=document.getElementById('mappings');let html='';[0,3,4,7,8,9].forEach(i=>{const j=(12-i)%12;const ok=consonant.has(j);html+=`<div class=\"mapping\"><span class=\"from\">${i}</span><span class=\"arrow\">↦</span><span class=\"to ${ok?'ok':'broken'}\">${j}</span><span style=\"color:#888;font-size:.8em;margin-left:5px\">${ok?'✓ consonant':'✗ dissonant!'}</span></div>`;});mappingsDiv.innerHTML=html;document.getElementById('toggle').addEventListener('click',function(){showMapping=!showMapping;this.classList.toggle('active');this.textContent=showMapping?'Show involution mapping':'Show involution mapping';draw();});draw();</script></body></html>"
    }
  ]
}
